      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CATCHING (2) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fifth (17.39) at this track latest. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from four starts. Looks the one to beat on her best form. VAPOUR GLOW (7) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 1.3 lengths second (16.98) over 300m at this track. Bold showing expected. RIPPIN' PEDRO (8) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish third, beaten 0.8 lengths, (16.77) at Murray Bridge. Must be included in calculations. CANYA JUMP (5) justified the favourite's tag last time and is sure to feature again.",
